{"seq":4,"slug":"awareness-and-presence","title":"Awareness 与在线感知（Presence）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/awareness-and-presence","wordCount":1725,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"awareness-与在线感知-presence\">Awareness 与在线感知（Presence）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Awareness（感知）和 Presence（在线状态）是协作应用的&quot;轻量状态&quot;——谁在线、光标位置、选择区域、正在输入指示器等。这些状态是临时的（不持久化），与文档状态分开处理（不参与冲突合并）。Yjs 内置了 awareness API，Liveblocks 提供 React hooks，PartyKit 和 Replicache 也支持此功能。多人光标和在线感知让协作应用感觉&quot;鲜活&quot;——看到其他用户的存在能提升生产力和信任感。本节介绍 awareness API（Yjs）、presence 模式（Liveblocks）、性能考量（光标更新高频）以及 UX 模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文档状态</td>\n<td>文本内容、布局</td>\n<td>CRDT 持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Awareness 状态</td>\n<td>光标、选择区域</td>\n<td>临时，不同步存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Presence 状态</td>\n<td>在线用户</td>\n<td>临时，广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户身份</td>\n<td>姓名、头像、颜色</td>\n<td>应用层管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"awareness-与文档状态的区别\">Awareness 与文档状态的区别</h2><p><strong>文档状态</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>持久化。</li>\n<li>由 CRDT 追踪。</li>\n<li>需要冲突解决。</li>\n<li>示例：文本内容、布局、设置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Awareness 状态</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>临时的（每个会话）。</li>\n<li>断开连接时不持久化。</li>\n<li>不参与冲突合并。</li>\n<li>示例：光标位置、选择区域、在线状态、正在输入指示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>为什么要分开</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标每秒更新 100 次，不应污染文档历史。</li>\n<li>用户断开连接后光标消失（正确的 UX 行为）。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[协作状态] --&gt; B[文档状态]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Awareness 状态]&#10;    B --&gt; D[持久化 CRDT]&#10;    B --&gt; E[冲突解决]&#10;    B --&gt; F[存储到数据库]&#10;    C --&gt; G[临时会话]&#10;    C --&gt; H[断开后消失]&#10;    C --&gt; I[高频更新]\">graph TD\n    A[协作状态] --&gt; B[文档状态]\n    A --&gt; C[Awareness 状态]\n    B --&gt; D[持久化 CRDT]\n    B --&gt; E[冲突解决]\n    B --&gt; F[存储到数据库]\n    C --&gt; G[临时会话]\n    C --&gt; H[断开后消失]\n    C --&gt; I[高频更新]</pre><h2 id=\"yjs-awareness-api\">Yjs Awareness API</h2><p><strong>内置于 y-websocket</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const provider = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;wss://...&#39;, &#39;room&#39;, doc);&#10;&#10;// 设置本地状态&#10;provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;user&#39;, {&#10;  name: &#39;Alice&#39;,&#10;  color: &#39;#ff0000&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;cursor&#39;, {&#10;  x: 100,&#10;  y: 200,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 监听状态变化&#10;provider.awareness.on(&#39;change&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const states = Array.from(provider.awareness.getStates().values());&#10;  console.log(states); // 所有用户的 awareness 状态&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const provider = new WebsocketProvider('wss://...', 'room', doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 设置本地状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('user', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'Alice',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  color: '#ff0000',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('cursor', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x: 100,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y: 200,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 监听状态变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.on('change', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const states = Array.from(provider.awareness.getStates().values());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(states); // 所有用户的 awareness 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>内部机制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个客户端发布自己的状态。</li>\n<li>其他用户接收状态更新。</li>\n<li>不存储在 Y.Doc 中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"光标追踪\">光标追踪</h2><p><strong>鼠标位置追踪</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"document.addEventListener(&#10;  &#39;mousemove&#39;,&#10;  throttle((e) =&gt; {&#10;    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;cursor&#39;, {&#10;      x: e.clientX,&#10;      y: e.clientY,&#10;    });&#10;  }, 50),&#10;); // 节流 20 Hz\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>document.addEventListener(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'mousemove',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  throttle((e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('cursor', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      x: e.clientX,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      y: e.clientY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, 50),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>); // 节流 20 Hz</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>节流/防抖</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每秒 100 次鼠标移动事件太多。</li>\n<li>20-30 Hz 是最佳平衡点。</li>\n<li>减少网络流量和 CPU 开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"选择区域追踪\">选择区域追踪</h2><p><strong>文本选择追踪</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"editor.on(&#39;selectionUpdate&#39;, ({ editor }) =&gt; {&#10;  const { from, to } = editor.state.selection;&#10;  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;selection&#39;, { from, to });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>editor.on('selectionUpdate', ({ editor }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { from, to } = editor.state.selection;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('selection', { from, to });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>在光标或选择变化时更新</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多人光标-ux\">多人光标 UX</h2><p><strong>渲染其他用户的光标</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function MultiplayerCursors() {&#10;  const [states, setStates] = useState([]);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const update = () =&gt; {&#10;      const arr = Array.from(provider.awareness.getStates().entries())&#10;        .filter(([id]) =&gt; id !== provider.awareness.clientID)&#10;        .map(([id, state]) =&gt; ({ id, ...state }));&#10;      setStates(arr);&#10;    };&#10;    provider.awareness.on(&#39;change&#39;, update);&#10;    return () =&gt; provider.awareness.off(&#39;change&#39;, update);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return states.map((s) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;div&#10;      key={s.id}&#10;      className=&quot;remote-cursor&quot;&#10;      style={{&#10;        position: &#39;absolute&#39;,&#10;        left: s.cursor?.x,&#10;        top: s.cursor?.y,&#10;        color: s.user?.color,&#10;      }}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      &lt;span&gt;{s.user?.name}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  ));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function MultiplayerCursors() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [states, setStates] = useState([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const update = () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const arr = Array.from(provider.awareness.getStates().entries())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(([id]) => id !== provider.awareness.clientID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(([id, state]) => ({ id, ...state }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setStates(arr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    provider.awareness.on('change', update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => provider.awareness.off('change', update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return states.map((s) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      key={s.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      className=\"remote-cursor\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        position: 'absolute',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        left: s.cursor?.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        top: s.cursor?.y,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        color: s.user?.color,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;span>{s.user?.name}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标 + 用户名。</li>\n<li>每用户不同颜色。</li>\n<li>更新之间的平滑动画。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"在线用户-presence\">在线用户（Presence）</h2><p><strong>显示房间内的用户</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function OnlineUsers() {&#10;  const [users, setUsers] = useState([]);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const update = () =&gt; {&#10;      const arr = Array.from(provider.awareness.getStates().values())&#10;        .map((s) =&gt; s.user)&#10;        .filter(Boolean);&#10;      setUsers(arr);&#10;    };&#10;    provider.awareness.on(&#39;change&#39;, update);&#10;    return () =&gt; provider.awareness.off(&#39;change&#39;, update);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;presence&quot;&gt;&#10;      {users.map((u) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;Avatar key={u.id} src={u.avatar} title={u.name} color={u.color} /&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function OnlineUsers() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [users, setUsers] = useState([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const update = () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const arr = Array.from(provider.awareness.getStates().values())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map((s) => s.user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(Boolean);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setUsers(arr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    provider.awareness.on('change', update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => provider.awareness.off('change', update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"presence\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {users.map((u) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Avatar key={u.id} src={u.avatar} title={u.name} color={u.color} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>UX 设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>头像堆叠显示。</li>\n<li>用户多时显示 &quot;+N&quot;。</li>\n<li>点击头像可跳转到该用户光标位置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"正在输入指示器\">正在输入指示器</h2><p><strong>聊天风格的&quot;Alice 正在输入...&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"let typingTimeout;&#10;input.addEventListener(&#39;input&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;typing&#39;, true);&#10;  clearTimeout(typingTimeout);&#10;  typingTimeout = setTimeout(() =&gt; {&#10;    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;typing&#39;, false);&#10;  }, 2000);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let typingTimeout;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>input.addEventListener('input', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('typing', true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  clearTimeout(typingTimeout);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  typingTimeout = setTimeout(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('typing', false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, 2000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>渲染</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"const typingUsers = states.filter((s) =&gt; s.typing).map((s) =&gt; s.user.name);&#10;return typingUsers.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; &lt;p&gt;{typingUsers.join(&#39;, &#39;)} 正在输入...&lt;/p&gt;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const typingUsers = states.filter((s) => s.typing).map((s) => s.user.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return typingUsers.length > 0 &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;p>{typingUsers.join(', ')} 正在输入...&#x3C;/p>;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"liveblocks-presence\">Liveblocks Presence</h2><p><strong>React hooks</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { useMyPresence, useOthers } from &#39;@liveblocks/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  const [myPresence, updateMyPresence] = useMyPresence();&#10;  const others = useOthers();&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    document.addEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;      updateMyPresence({ cursor: { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY } });&#10;    });&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;&gt;&#10;      &lt;MyCursor cursor={myPresence.cursor} /&gt;&#10;      {others.map((other) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;Cursor key={other.connectionId} cursor={other.presence.cursor} /&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useMyPresence, useOthers } from '@liveblocks/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [myPresence, updateMyPresence] = useMyPresence();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const others = useOthers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      updateMyPresence({ cursor: { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;MyCursor cursor={myPresence.cursor} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {others.map((other) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Cursor key={other.connectionId} cursor={other.presence.cursor} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>托管基础设施</strong>——Liveblocks 负责服务器管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h2><p><strong>高频更新问题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光标每秒 30+ 次更新。</li>\n<li>多用户 → 消息量指数级增长。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>优化策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>节流（50ms = 20 Hz）。</li>\n<li>批量处理（将光标和选择合并为一次更新）。</li>\n<li>只发送变化的部分（Delta）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>服务器压力</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Awareness 的扇出（Fan-out）广播。</li>\n<li>使用高效的消息代理（如 Redis 发布/订阅）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>带宽考量</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每秒每个用户 1 条消息已经很重。</li>\n<li>100 用户 × 30 Hz = 每秒 3000 条消息。</li>\n<li>可考虑压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"awareness-持久化\">Awareness 持久化</h2><p><strong>断开连接时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Awareness 状态应该消失。</li>\n<li>其他用户不应看到幽灵光标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Yjs 自动处理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>断开连接时广播移除消息。</li>\n<li>其他用户自动过滤掉。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>过期的 Awareness</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 30 秒内没有更新，强制超时。</li>\n<li>移除不活跃的用户状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"用户身份\">用户身份</h2><p><strong>持久化身份信息</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户资料存储在数据库（姓名、头像）。</li>\n<li>认证令牌（Auth Token）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>附加到 Awareness</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;user&#39;, {&#10;  id: currentUser.id,&#10;  name: currentUser.name,&#10;  avatar: currentUser.avatar,&#10;  color: assignColor(currentUser.id),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('user', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: currentUser.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: currentUser.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  avatar: currentUser.avatar,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  color: assignColor(currentUser.id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>稳定的颜色分配</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过用户 ID 哈希生成一致的颜色。</li>\n<li>同一用户总是显示相同颜色。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"颜色分配算法\">颜色分配算法</h2><p><strong>从用户 ID 生成颜色</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function assignColor(userId) {&#10;  const colors = [&#39;#FF6B6B&#39;, &#39;#4ECDC4&#39;, &#39;#45B7D1&#39;, &#39;#FFA07A&#39;, &#39;#98D8C8&#39;, &#39;#F7DC6F&#39;, &#39;#BB8FCE&#39;, &#39;#85C1E2&#39;];&#10;  const hash = userId.split(&#39;&#39;).reduce((a, c) =&gt; a + c.charCodeAt(0), 0);&#10;  return colors[hash % colors.length];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function assignColor(userId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const colors = ['#FF6B6B', '#4ECDC4', '#45B7D1', '#FFA07A', '#98D8C8', '#F7DC6F', '#BB8FCE', '#85C1E2'];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const hash = userId.split('').reduce((a, c) => a + c.charCodeAt(0), 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return colors[hash % colors.length];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>颜色选择原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>颜色间有足够区分度。</li>\n<li>对色盲用户友好（可访问性）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"光标动画\">光标动画</h2><p><strong>平滑移动</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".remote-cursor {&#10;  transition: transform 100ms ease;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.remote-cursor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transform </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ms</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>20 Hz 的节流更新 + 动画填补间隔。</li>\n<li>视觉上更流畅。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>或使用插值</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>追踪速度。</li>\n<li>预测下一个位置。</li>\n<li>减少卡顿感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"选择区域高亮\">选择区域高亮</h2><p><strong>显示其他用户的选择</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"{&#10;  others.map(&#10;    (o) =&gt;&#10;      o.selection &amp;&amp; (&#10;        &lt;SelectionOverlay&#10;          key={o.id}&#10;          from={o.selection.from}&#10;          to={o.selection.to}&#10;          color={o.user.color}&#10;          name={o.user.name}&#10;        /&gt;&#10;      ),&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  others.map(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (o) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      o.selection &#x26;&#x26; (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;SelectionOverlay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          key={o.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          from={o.selection.from}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          to={o.selection.to}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          color={o.user.color}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          name={o.user.name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>视觉效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在选中文本上显示半透明矩形。</li>\n<li>显示用户名标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"隐私设置\">隐私设置</h2><p><strong>Awareness 会暴露用户活动</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户可能不希望分享闲置状态或输入状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>设置选项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>切换&quot;显示我的光标&quot;。</li>\n<li>匿名模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>细粒度控制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按房间设置。</li>\n<li>按团队设置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 将 Awareness 存储在 Y.Doc 中</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>会污染文档历史。</li>\n<li>应使用独立的 awareness API。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 高频更新不节流</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导致服务器过载。</li>\n<li>应节流到 20 Hz。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 断开后不移除状态</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产生幽灵光标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 所有用户使用相同颜色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>造成混淆。</li>\n<li>应为每用户分配不同颜色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 不显示用户身份</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>匿名光标价值较低。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 使用 Yjs awareness API</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>或 Liveblocks（如使用 PaaS）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 节流到 20-30 Hz</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流畅且网络开销合理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 颜色编码</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用有区分度且可访问的颜色调色板。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 显示头像和姓名</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>身份信息清晰可见。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 添加动画</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CSS transition 或插值实现平滑效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 提供隐私选项</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>让用户可以禁用光标显示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代模式\">现代模式</h2><p><strong>1. 带姓名的实时光标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Figma 风格。</li>\n<li>现已成为行业标准。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 点击光标跳转</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>视角跟随到该用户位置。</li>\n<li>适合审阅场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 语音 + 光标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>协作时一键通话。</li>\n<li>与 WebRTC 集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. AI Agent 光标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在人类旁边显示 AI 编辑操作。</li>\n<li>新兴模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Awareness 和 Presence 是协作应用的&quot;轻量状态&quot;——光标、选择区域、输入状态、在线状态等，这些临时状态不持久化也不参与冲突合并，与文档状态分开处理（光标每秒 100 次更新不应污染历史）。Yjs awareness API 内置于 y-websocket，通过 provider.awareness.setLocalStateField 设置状态，on(&#39;change&#39;) 获取所有用户状态。光标追踪通过 mousemove 事件节流到 20-30 Hz（50ms）。选择追踪通过编辑器的 selectionUpdate 事件发布 from/to。多人光标 UX 渲染其他用户光标，配合颜色编码和姓名标签及动画。在线用户以头像堆叠形式显示，点击可跳转。输入指示器通过 setTimeout 在输入事件后重置。Liveblocks 提供 React hooks（useMyPresence + useOthers）及托管基础设施。高频更新优化策略：节流 50ms、批量合并、只发送变化部分、使用高效代理（Redis）进行扇出。断开连接时 Yjs 自动移除，过期状态 30 秒超时强制移除。用户身份附加姓名/头像/颜色，稳定颜色通过哈希用户 ID 到调色板索引（8-12 种有区分度的可访问颜色）。光标动画使用 CSS transition 100ms 或插值追踪速度预测。选择高亮使用半透明矩形覆盖和姓名标签。隐私设置包括切换&quot;显示光标&quot;、匿名模式、按房间细粒度控制。反模式：awareness 存在 Y.Doc（污染历史）、高频不节流、断开不移除（幽灵光标）、相同颜色（混淆）、无身份信息。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Awareness 与在线感知（Presence）","id":"awareness-与在线感知-presence"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Awareness 与文档状态的区别","id":"awareness-与文档状态的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs Awareness API","id":"yjs-awareness-api"},{"level":2,"text":"光标追踪","id":"光标追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"选择区域追踪","id":"选择区域追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"多人光标 UX","id":"多人光标-ux"},{"level":2,"text":"在线用户（Presence）","id":"在线用户-presence"},{"level":2,"text":"正在输入指示器","id":"正在输入指示器"},{"level":2,"text":"Liveblocks Presence","id":"liveblocks-presence"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Awareness 持久化","id":"awareness-持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"用户身份","id":"用户身份"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色分配算法","id":"颜色分配算法"},{"level":2,"text":"光标动画","id":"光标动画"},{"level":2,"text":"选择区域高亮","id":"选择区域高亮"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私设置","id":"隐私设置"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"现代模式","id":"现代模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"操作变换（OT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/operational-transform"},"next":{"title":"多人光标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/multiplayer-cursors"}}